+
+`Esc` cancels a command line or an in-progress save prompt. Opening a file
+that is already open switches to it instead of duplicating it. The status
+line shows `current/total` buffers and marks the current one with `*` when
+modified. Each buffer keeps its own cursor position and undo history.
 
